WEBVTT

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.240
It was so long.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.540
Truly a long journey.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:13.880
I have followed this path for 20 years.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.550
Yet I couldn't hold a candle to the girls of that mansion.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.750
However, this is the perfect chance.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.860
Surely today.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:29.660
Today will definitely be the day
I get all the treasure.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.600
So...

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:39.140
Master Keita ate
Yoko's chocolate cake.

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.200
He got punished after that.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:45.880
After that, Kappa and a cat came, and things went haywire.

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:48.440
As usual, it's so lively over there.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:52.080
Still, he really is bold.

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.120
To build that house under a bridge.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.950
It's because he's stupid.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:00.520
Last time, they ran an electric line and had a TV running.

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:05.660
When I went and brought them food, they cooked me a fish as thanks.

00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:08.700
Huh, you brought them food?

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:10.230
Well, yeah.

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.470
You can't do that.

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:14.200
If you feed them, it'll become a habit.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.640
They're not wild animals.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:21.240
But you went to their place recently didn't you, Tayune?

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:26.520
I was just wondering what kind of miserable life they're having.

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:29.090
I just went to look.

00:01:29.090 --> 00:01:30.320
Oh, my.

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.390
Tayune's in fat with Master Keita.

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:34.660
She's gotten love lately.

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:37.760
You guys.
You're doing that on purpose.

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:40.600
I was never in love to begin with.

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:42.260
Hey, wait.

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:46.200
Lately everyone is no longer scared of Master Keita.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:48.540
He's actually a good person.

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:49.840
Yes.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.480
What's wrong, Gokyoya?

00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:58.680
Huh? No, never mind.

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:04.950
I'm sorry, but I will be going first.

00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:18.500
Lately, I've been thinking more and more of you.

00:02:23.470 --> 00:02:26.640
I guess I just really can't forget you.

00:02:35.780 --> 00:02:39.560
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:42.860
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:49.730
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:06.250
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:13.360
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:19.930
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:27.670
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:32.440
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:36.250
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:39.380
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:03:39.380 --> 00:03:45.250
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:03:45.820 --> 00:03:49.530
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:52.830
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:59.030
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:04.940
Emotions to White Cloth!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:13.720
Gokyoya?

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.020
We're worried so we came.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:17.990
Dizzy from the bath?

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.490
Who's there?

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:29.630
Just my imagination?

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.070
I'm surprised.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:36.140
As expected of Gokyoya. She's sharp.

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:40.380
But this is a serious problem, Tensou.

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:44.750
I mean, Gokyoya must be in love with Master Keita.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.120
Really?

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.780
Of course she is.

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:51.690
Otherwise, there's no way she'd have that picture.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:52.990
Is that so?

00:04:53.320 --> 00:04:57.460
Tensou, I just thought of an incredible idea.

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:00.400
We should pitch in,

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.670
and help Gokyoya.

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.770
- Really?
- Really.

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:08.770
I mean, we've always been under Gokyoya's care.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.910
I have a hard time opening up to people.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.280
But I'm getting along with everyone.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.510
Thanks to Gokyoya.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:21.450
You're the same too, right?

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:25.050
Yeah. I owe Gokyoya.
I'd like to repay her.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:28.820
Let's do it. Now that it's come to this, let's hurry up.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:31.560
Straight to Master Keita's house.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:32.490
Yeah.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:01.560
I finally managed to get this far.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.660
It was so long.
Truly a long journey.

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.260
Uh-oh, not good.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:12.370
I've been crying a lot lately.
Can't do that.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:16.040
First, the fruits of glory.
I'll thoroughly enjoy them.

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.410
This is your third try just this week.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:29.950
Good grief. You still didn't learn even after all that beating.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.090
Your presence is too easy to notice.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.390
No excuses for you now.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.260
Hope you wrote your will.

00:06:39.430 --> 00:06:41.360
Well, we won't kill you.

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:44.600
Well, maybe kill him a bit.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.400
Well then, it's time for...

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.340
Punishment.

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:51.640
Help me!

00:07:12.690 --> 00:07:14.100
How pathetic.

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:18.270
I left town for a while and this is how you end up.

00:07:18.570 --> 00:07:23.340
Be the unbeknownst, reach the unreachable.

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:25.270
I taught you so.

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.120
You're...

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.980
Master!

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.590
The rain's pretty harsh.

00:07:42.590 --> 00:07:45.160
I wonder if
Master Keita's home is all right.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:51.000
Oh, no. Yoko, put the basin there.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.500
No. I'm getting wet.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.740
Darn, this is soaked.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.740
What's with you guys?

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:04.580
Actually, we came to ask you a favor.

00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.250
What is it, all of the sudden?

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.550
We want you to take Gokyoya on a date.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.160
Me?

00:08:13.160 --> 00:08:14.160
Yes.

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:15.060
With Gokyoya?

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.060
Yes.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:16.990
A date?

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:18.330
You heard her.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:22.500
No, totally not allowed.

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:24.000
Absolutely not!

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:28.640
No way. Please do something about it, Master Keita.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:32.540
Gokyoya was treasuring a picture of you.

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:34.010
Huh? My picture?

00:08:34.440 --> 00:08:38.110
Yes. I'm sure Gokyoya loves you.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.780
But it's hard for her because she can't say.

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.350
I feel for her.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:47.260
That's why. Please ask her on a date.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.660
Hang on a sec.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.730
It's too sudden.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.700
What's the meaning of this?

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.130
No, I don't even know what's going on.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:08:58.400
Huh? Wait.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:04.110
Oh, I see.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:05.570
It's probably...

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:08.880
Well, if that's the case, I'll do it.

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:13.380
Keita, you cheater.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:16.620
Hey, listen to me first!

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:24.360
That's why, Master. I'm so frustrated.

00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:25.790
I see.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.230
They're an interesting opponent.

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:32.500
Interesting? They're not that soft.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:37.410
No matter how much I hide my presence, they always know.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.540
And the horrifying punishment when they find me.

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:45.580
It's the only place where
I was never able to capture my prey.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.450
Interesting.

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:50.390
The girls who gave you such a hard time.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:53.390
I would like to test my skills against them.

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:54.360
But, Master.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:58.130
Do you think I would lose?

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.600
No, no such thing. But...

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.640
My disciple.

00:10:09.070 --> 00:10:13.610
Your bad habit is to give in to desire and immediately show weakness.

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.010
Stand up.

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:22.990
Let me show you.

00:10:22.990 --> 00:10:26.490
A technique born from my training across countries.

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:28.360
The first strike is decisive.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:31.060
White Cloth Reversal.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.540
The path of underwear is the path of battles.

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.880
Hesitate once and you'll be captured.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:48.840
It is the path of savages.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.420
"Inukami!"

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.990
Woof woof.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.130
"Inukami!"

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.000
Woof woof.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:15.240
Geez, why did Furano make me come all the way here?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.010
Hey, Gokyoya.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.880
Master Keita?

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.180
Did I make you wait?

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:23.980
Huh?

00:11:23.980 --> 00:11:26.150
What's the meaning of this?

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:28.250
Look, it's fine.

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.550
Just stick with me for a bit.

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:32.320
First, let's go to a boutique.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:39.060
He has never been that nice to me.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.030
Gosh!

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:41.330
Calm down.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:42.930
Don't be mad.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:50.470
She's here, Master.

00:11:50.470 --> 00:11:52.910
She's one of those girls.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:11.090
My hands shall pick 100 blooming flowers.

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:13.100
Secret technique,
White Cloth Reversal.

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.430
Wait, no, what?

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.300
I can't believe it.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.840
Truly god-like.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:25.870
Too easy. Is that it?

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:29.580
Where are you going?

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:34.380
I'm looking for a stronger opponent that can entertain me.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.820
There are still more impenetrable girls, no?

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.620
I will give this to you.

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:43.260
I have lost interest in it.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:51.770
No, this isn't...

00:12:51.770 --> 00:12:52.970
You're wrong.

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.740
Die, you pervert.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:07.250
Secret technique,
White Cloth Reversal.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:12.420
It's a beautiful cafe.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.390
You're right.

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:18.960
What?

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.840
The fruit is not yet ripe.
Let's not.

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.780
What's wrong, Nadeshiko?

00:13:34.780 --> 00:13:37.750
No, I think it's just my imagination.

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.690
Stronger.

00:13:46.690 --> 00:13:49.020
I want stronger ones.

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:59.130
Um, Master Keita?

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:00.700
Hmm? Oh.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.310
That looks nice on you, Gokyoya.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.070
Thank you very much.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:09.710
But is it really okay to have you buy these?

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:11.580
I don't mind.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:15.980
Like I said, it's what
Furano and Tensou wanted.

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.290
But...

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.560
They want to repay you for your kindness.

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:24.530
I was just asked to help.
Don't worry.

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:25.890
Okay.

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:29.500
Right then. Let's wear that and go somewhere.

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:33.300
Actually, there's something
I want to talk about.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:37.010
Sure, if you don't mind.

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:42.810
I have something to say too.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.380
Viewing Platform

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:52.620
I can't hold it anymore.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:57.230
I can't forgive that happy scene.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:01.000
Keita only belongs to me.

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:02.930
Hey, Yoko.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:08.800
Too slow, too easy.

00:15:14.710 --> 00:15:16.410
What are you doing?

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:21.350
In this moment I risk my life, the flame of my spirit burns.

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:25.090
Therefore, this is nothing but a result.

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:30.230
You're stealing underwear.
Why are you spouting nonsense?

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:32.930
You big pervert.

00:15:33.190 --> 00:15:34.400
Evil Blaze!

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:37.030
Oh, my.

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:39.500
You can still entertain me?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:42.870
Wait up, pervert.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.410
Not a chance.

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:52.780
There's no way you could catch me with moves like that.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:56.920
I found you, pervert.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:15:59.350
There he is.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.330
Wait!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:19.610
Wow, we can see quite the distance.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:21.210
You're right.

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.180
If it's clear you can see the mountain with the Kawahira home.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:29.620
Have you been here before?

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.620
Yes, several times.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.460
In that direction.

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.900
Far in that direction is England, where my father's at.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:44.170
He told me the direction once.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:46.500
You come to see that?

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.640
I found out recently.

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:56.910
Before becoming Kaoru's Inukami, you were Dad's Inukami.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:03.150
I heard you worked the hardest among Dad's Inukami.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:07.660
But Dad left you alone.

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.860
No.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.530
Your father did nothing wrong.

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:17.000
Master Soutaro... Your father...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:21.140
I admired him too much without thinking about my place.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:24.670
Thanks to that,
I was hated by your mother.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:27.710
Sorry.

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:33.080
Could it be that you brought me here today to ask that?

00:17:33.380 --> 00:17:34.720
Yeah.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:37.850
I heard you're still keeping a picture of my father.

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:40.460
Did Furano and Tensou tell you that?

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:44.460
They mistook it as my picture though.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.230
You were separated from my father you loved.

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.500
It must have been sad and frustrating.

00:17:52.930 --> 00:17:54.100
I'm sorry.

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:57.770
I wanted to apologize as his son.

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.180
I'm really sorry.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:06.180
Thank you, Gokyoya.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:11.090
You're a nice person that cares about her master and friends.

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:15.560
Master Souta...

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:17.330
No, Master Keita.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.300
You don't need to apologize.

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:25.770
I'm now Master Kaoru's Inukami, and have lots of friends.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:27.600
And most importantly,

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:31.870
I can meet you, his family.
I'm truly happy.

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:33.580
Gokyoya.

00:18:33.910 --> 00:18:39.250
Of course, I was holding a grudge against Master Soutaro at first.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:42.420
I understand.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:45.850
Then I'll have to make up for various things to you.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:48.690
Anything that I could do, just say it.

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.760
Really?

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:51.630
Then, from now on...

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:54.700
An opening in a maiden's heart.

00:18:59.170 --> 00:19:00.740
How mysterious.

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:05.010
Mastering a technique to this level is actually unsatisfying.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:07.110
There he is.

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:11.010
What's going on?

00:19:12.350 --> 00:19:13.410
Get ready.

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:35.440
How beautiful.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.370
The underwear is like falling petals.

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:47.150
Die, pervert.

00:19:52.820 --> 00:19:56.690
To think I was bewitched by flying underwear.

00:19:57.060 --> 00:20:01.600
I was so confident in my technique.
Yet I am just inexperienced.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.770
How funny.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:04.730
You...

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:06.430
What are you laughing about?

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:08.840
More divine punishment.

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:19.610
Die, die, you pervert.

00:20:19.610 --> 00:20:22.780
I see, so that's it.

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:24.920
Not the son, but the father.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.120
Furano, Tensou.

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:31.560
Seems like you were worried about me. Thank you.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.430
Not really.

00:20:34.430 --> 00:20:37.130
It's a given.
You always take care of us.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:41.340
That's right. We're friends, Gokyoya.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.610
I told you.

00:20:45.610 --> 00:20:47.980
Not me, it's my father.

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:51.310
But I still can't accept it.

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.880
And you saw my private parts!

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:55.450
Excuse me?

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:01.620
Geez, they're noisy as usual.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:06.260
Well, it may get even noisier.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:13.470
From now on, I've decided to interact more with Master Keita.

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:21.280
He's just like you, Master Soutaro.

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:43.030
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:48.470
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:53.610
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:58.980
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.020
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:04.590
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:07.290
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:10.730
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.330
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:21.570
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:24.040
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.670
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.670 --> 00:22:32.850
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:35.580
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:41.960
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:50.400 --> 00:22:53.870
Inukami!

00:22:53.870 --> 00:22:54.970
See you!

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:57.570
The little kid, Tomohane.

00:22:57.570 --> 00:23:00.710
Her lovely appearance sometimes attracts me.

00:23:00.710 --> 00:23:02.110
No, you're wrong.

00:23:02.110 --> 00:23:03.680
I'm not like that.

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:06.850
But, those bouncy twin tails.

00:23:06.850 --> 00:23:11.620
The fact that she's a little bit clumsy makes her irreplaceable.

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:15.290
I can understand why people are obsessed over her.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:18.260
Next on Inukami.

00:23:18.260 --> 00:23:19.430
"Hang On, Tomohane!"

00:23:19.430 --> 00:23:19.960
No, you're wrong.

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:21.830
Hang On, Tomohane!

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:23.660
I'm not obsessed with her...

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:24.970
Hang On, Tomohane!
